#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "For the Qiskit Runtime, or Qiskit IBM Transpiler MCP Servers:\n"
msgstr "W przypadku serwerów MCP Qiskit Runtime lub Qiskit IBM Transpiler:\n"

